WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
A stern green visor peers out of scratched cheddar armor.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.400
The cheese soldier shoulders an enormous box-grater rifle in a cold-storage loading bay.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.850
The grater recoils as a volley of cheddar shavings accelerates across the bay.

4
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.650
The shavings burst against a stack of supply tins, scattering it across the floor.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.350
The soldier straightens for a proud military salute. His armor begins to sag.

6
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.800
He keeps saluting while his cheesy victory slowly melts. A refrigeration reminder lands beside him.
